adero cuello de botella es la CoWoS desarrollado por TSMC.  \nPara el 2027 con altísima demanda de TPU y GPU's se puede producir una acumulación de HBM por este cuello de botella\nhttps://t.co/ir8Q8VX21X","url":"https://x.com/SesAlpha/status/2111658985535500648"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112042801546571776"]},"author_id":"2033827512028172290","created_at":"2026-10-19T04:47:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112042825240166581"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/CodNGoCiRr","end":298,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/BottleneckHQ/status/2112042825240166581/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112042801546571776","start":275,"url":"https://t.co/CodNGoCiRr"}]},"id":"2112042825240166581","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":32,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"The real story behind Samsung bending the knee to TSMC: NVIDIA’s NVHBM architecture pivot.\n\nWhy did Jensen Huang force Samsung to produce custom HBM base dies on TSMC's 3nm node?\nIt's pure physical economics (Teardown below):\n\n1. Compute Reclamation (+25% Silicon Freed):\nIn https://t.co/CodNGoCiRr","url":"https://x.com/BottleneckHQ/status/2112042825240166581"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112116649780539392","3_2112116668961038336","3_2112116668977815552"]},"author_id":"380820651","created_at":"2026-10-19T10:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112121582030110884"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/TPC6oLPIRJ","end":298,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Leoskie_L/status/2112121582030110884/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112116649780539392","start":275,"url":"https://t.co/TPC6oLPIRJ"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/TPC6oLPIRJ","end":298,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Leoskie_L/status/2112121582030110884/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112116668961038336","start":275,"url":"https://t.co/TPC6oLPIRJ"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/TPC6oLPIRJ","end":298,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Leoskie_L/status/2112121582030110884/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112116668977815552","start":275,"url":"https://t.co/TPC6oLPIRJ"}]},"id":"2112121582030110884","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":1097,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Most people think the HBM shortage is about memory makers not expanding fast enough. But Nvidia's custom HBM ties the foundation of every stack to TSMC 3nm.\n\nYesterday I wrote that SK hynix was evaluating TSMC 3nm for its HBM4E base die. Today Samsung is on board too. Seoul https://t.co/TPC6oLPIRJ","url":"https://x.com/Leoskie_L/status/2112121582030110884"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112003702219538432"]},"author_id":"2033827512028172290","created_at":"2026-10-19T02:11:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112003774864871500"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/eSv2iSR8Bw","end":222,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/AguAqiang/status/2112003774864871500/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112003702219538432","start":199,"url":"https://t.co/eSv2iSR8Bw"}]},"id":"2112003774864871500","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":16,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"A historic truce in semiconductors: Samsung has to bend the knee to TSMC, forced by NVIDIA.\n\n今天半导体圈最震撼的底牌：英伟达为了保证下一代定制 HBM（NVHBM）的性能一致性，直接向三大存储巨头下了死命令——三星、SK海力士和美光，必须统一采用台积电（TSMC）的 3nm 制程代工底层基片（Base https://t.co/eSv2iSR8Bw","url":"https://x.com/BottleneckHQ/status/2112003774864871500"},{"author_id":"1844040351029628928","created_at":"2026-10-19T10:30:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112129157610041833"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/17451060827903…","end":174,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/1745106082790318080/status/2112069964131713517","start":151,"url":"https://t.co/u4fJDlX6Ht"}]},"id":"2112129157610041833","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":25,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"SemiAnalysis、2027年はデータセンターが+50GW増えるとみている。建設中は60GW、今年のリース契約は累計1.3兆ドル。\n\n見出しには「不足はチップに移りうる」とある。建屋と電力が先に埋まれば、次は中身が詰まる。\n\nCoWoSを握るTSMCと、HBMのSK hynixが最初だと思う。 https://t.co/u4fJDlX6Ht","url":"https://x.com/ichi_1111_1111/status/2112129157610041833"},{"author_id":"2091854670272573441","created_at":"2026-10-19T07:30:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112084077071274435"],"id":"2112084077071274435","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":26,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🔬 LE BRIEF SEMI-CONDUCTEURS EN 5 - 19/10/2026\n\n🏭 ASML voit la demande dépasser ses capacités\n\n📈 TSMC signe un nouveau trimestre record\n\n🧠 SK hynix prépare l’après-HBM avec CXL et HBF\n\n🛡️ Pékin veut contrôler certaines technologies IA\n\n🤖 NVIDIA imposerait TSMC pour sa future","url":"https://x.com/LeBriefEn5/status/2112084077071274435"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112254418821300225"]},"author_id":"17787749","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:47:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112254427285410300"],"entities":{"cashtags":[{"end":5,"start":0,"tag":"AMKR"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/8dZKJOIoU8","end":297,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/demonbabies/status/2112254427285410300/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112254418821300225","start":274,"url":"https://t.co/8dZKJOIoU8"}]},"id":"2112254427285410300","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":31,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"$AMKR expanding its Arizona advanced-packaging footprint to roughly $12B gets my attention for one reason:\n\nThe packaging bottleneck is still nowhere close to being solved.\n\nEveryone watches TSMC’s CoWoS capacity.\n\nBut the industry is still short roughly 10–20% on advanced https://t.co/8dZKJOIoU8","url":"https://x.com/demonbabies/status/2112254427285410300"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112067082435383296","3_2112067082485702657"]},"author_id":"1988454162057826304","created_at":"2026-10-19T06:23:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112067161120497731"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_ur